 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/20 20:36| 01 | 039| 020| 0507| 0230| 0164| 0795|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/20 19:48| 01 | 314| 026| 0278| 0012| 0263| 0302|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/20 12:12| 02 | 064| 026| 0251| 0163| 0130| 0529|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/07/20 09:00| 08 | 270| 090| 0365| 0082| 0229| 0600|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/07/20 02:00| 02 | 227| 076| 0327| 0039| 0238| 0400|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/07/20 01:36| 01 | 292| 014| 026"
